<p>Call upon the will of all of the Orc Prides to survive this battle.</p><p>You remove up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 2, 3, 4</acronym> detrimental effect(s) then heal for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Willpower 100">204, 249, 283, 311, 335</acronym> life.</p><p>The healing will increase with talent level and your Willpower.</p>